# 系统退出先存盘（第二阶段修复的回归）：局内走两步后走系统退出（Mac：退出 Apple 事件，同程序坞「退出」；iOS：applicationWillTerminate 那条），
# 进程自己退出、退出码 0，且退出前有存档提交
# System quit saves first (regression of the phase 2 fixes): after a few steps in a run, quit through the system path (Mac: the quit Apple event, as Quit in the Dock; iOS: the applicationWillTerminate path);
# the process exits by itself with code 0, and a save was committed before it did
name system_quit_saves
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
stick 0 1 frames=40
system_quit
check saved
check exit 0
check no_red
check no_red_log
